Shaman: still.. they say that this group, TREASURE is like a single pine tree… and now that enough time has passed, another period has come where people around them will once again be there to support and help them… so they say that (they’ll be fine) as long as they continue moving forward in the direction they have always followed

S: what does a pine tree symbolize? It represents purity, focusing on a single path while fully believing/trusting in it as they go

S: and what that means is they are people whose greatest purpose is to be loved by their fans by showing exactly who they are and presenting themselves sincerely and authentically whenever they stand before them (((showing a clear and consistent image in front of the fans)))

///note: ‘people helping them’ suggests something like a favorable period when support or opportunities naturally come from those around them\\

//note: pine tree symbolizes loyalty, constancy, integrity, endurance and staying true to one path despite the passage of time///
